      "content": "okay i'll try the ibuprofen. i'll just monitor it from my couch. do you think i should take anything else with it to help with the pain? maybe some of those strong prescription painkillers i have left over from my surgery last year if the ibuprofen doesnt do much? i just really want to sleep this off.",
